   {
    "date": "2026-09-20",
    "kind": "correction",
    "kind_label": "Correction",
    "text": "CORRECTION to a 2026-09-19 finding: 'Mission Bay by Windsor' (360 Berry St) and Edgewater (355 Berry St) were concluded to be the same building via a 99.6% footprint-overlap check, and Windsor was never added as its own record. The owner directly corrected this -- they are two separate condo complexes, confirmed via DataSF Assessor parcels (distinct blklots: 8707003 for Edgewater, 8704004 for Windsor). This also explains a fragment that briefly got added to Edgewater's own record during today's positioning-review batch as an unexplained 'open-land strip along I-280': it was 96.7% the real, previously-untracked Windsor parcel. Reverted that from Edgewater and added Windsor as its own real status.csv record (blklot 8704004) instead. N4-3 is Windsor; N4A-3 is Edgewater.",
    "source": "docs/briefs/mission-bay-geometry.md",
    "sources": [
     {
      "title": "docs/briefs/mission-bay-geometry.md"
     }
    ],
