  "notes": "Mission Bay by Windsor, 360 Berry St -- apartment community (1-2 bed/1-2 bath units per current listings). Real, distinct parcel from the already-tracked Edgewater (355 Berry St, blklot 8707003) -- a 2026-09-19 pass had concluded these were the same building (a 99.6% footprint-overlap check against the wrong candidate geometry) and folded Windsor's real extent into Edgewater's own record as an unexplained 'open-land strip' near I-280; the owner corrected this directly (they are two separate condo complexes) and the real DataSF Assessor parcel boundary confirms it: blklot 8704004 at 360 Berry St, 96.7% overlapping the very shape wrongly parked under Edgewater. Uses the real Assessor parcel boundary rather than an OSM footprint since no distinct OSM way was found for it in this pass.",
